    "detailed_description": "Alone. Drifting in your vessel through the endless void for countless millennia. Until one day you are awakened...<br><br>Out Here Alone is a minimalist sci-fi/horror roguelite, featuring space combat, exploration, and local co-op multiplayer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pilot your vessel through the void, exploring eerie environments and fighting dangerous enemies<br></li><li>Explore procedurally generated ancient derelicts<br></li><li>Seamlessly switch between single player and local co-op modes - work together to control different aspects of your vessel<br></li><li>Upgrade your vessel's abilities, or unlock new ones for your next play-through</li></ul>",
